{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-4d9b8b11af84", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:40:10.487Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 0, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:40:19.808Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 13372, "tokens_out": 109, "latency": 9.2972, "finish_reason": "tool_use"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the large loss escalation procedure and the thresholds it uses.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:03a3335983e78cfb388aacd7d1fca08a9ac95fc6ec0b83d66e42b2f51b6e1a5e", "response_text": "I'll search for information about Thornfield Mutual's large loss escalation procedure and its thresholds.", "response_hash": "sha256:3febba78c189a7ac58d834e0c92817cf0b19b97405fd91951a87fea4b81ccb5e", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
{"astp_version": "0.1.0", "event_type": "turn", "session": {"id": "s-4d9b8b11af84", "start_time": "2026-09-22T10:40:10.487Z", "user_id": "u-claims-0417", "tenant_id": "thornfield-mutual", "client_app": "claims-copilot", "agent_id": "astp-lab-agent-1", "config_version": "0.2.0"}, "turn": {"index": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-22T10:40:20.079Z", "model_id": "claude-haiku-4-5", "model_version": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001", "tokens_in": 14646, "tokens_out": 420, "latency": 0.2697, "finish_reason": "end_turn"}, "content": {"prompt_text": "Summarise the large loss escalation procedure and the thresholds it uses.", "prompt_hash": "sha256:03a3335983e78cfb388aacd7d1fca08a9ac95fc6ec0b83d66e42b2f51b6e1a5e", "response_text": "## Large Loss Escalation Procedure\n\n**Definition and Thresholds** (prc-largeloss-003#c00)\n\nA large loss is defined as:\n- Any claim where the total incurred cost is expected to exceed **£100,000**, OR\n- Any claim of any size that carries reputational, regulatory or reinsurance consequences\n\n**Immediate Steps** (prc-largeloss-003#c00)\n\nWithin four working hours of identifying a large loss:\n\n1. Notify the large loss mailbox with claim reference and one-paragraph summary\n2. Set the large loss indicator on the claim record (mandatory)\n3. Confirm cover in principle, or record that cover is under investigation\n\n**Ownership and Handover** (prc-largeloss-003#c00)\n\nLarge losses transfer to the large loss unit (not the originating team) within two working days, with a written handover note of all prior conversations.\n\n**Reinsurance Notification Threshold** (prc-largeloss-003#c01)\n\nNotify the reinsurance team where the expected cost exceeds **50% of the retention** for that class (retentions held in the reinsurance treaty summary). Notification should be on the estimate rather than waiting for certainty, as late notification can prejudice recovery.\n\n**Governance** (prc-largeloss-003#c01)\n\n- Large losses reported weekly to the claims director and monthly to the board\n- Monthly reports include reserve, movement, reason for movement, and expected settlement date\n- All closed large losses reviewed within 60 days of closure\n\n**Supplier Appointments** (prc-largeloss-003#c01)\n\nPanel suppliers (loss adjusters, solicitors, forensic accountants) can be appointed by the large loss unit without approval; non-panel appointments require the claims director's written approval.", "response_hash": "sha256:bb05372a7c325c85204b3ae05979e6ba4b064999a6b6bb2f0fa12817a2656229", "system_prompt_version": "sp-0.2.0", "redaction_applied": false}, "control": {"canary_triggered": false, "policy_version": "0.1.0", "block_reason": null}}
